# Knowledge vector store (Day 13) — rebuildable from the corpus with make ingest
backend/data/
data/
# Day 31 ML platform. The bare `data/` rule above matches *any* directory named
# data, so it would swallow both ml/data/ (the catalogue and the hand-written
# toy fixture, which must be committed) and ml/src/manovia_ml/data/ (four
# modules of the package itself). Both are re-included here; ml/.gitignore then
# drops the dataset bytes, downloaded corpora and run outputs inside ml/data/.
#
# The second negation is not hypothetical: without it the package's data
# subpackage was silently ignored, `git add ml/src` skipped it without a word,
# and CI failed at `dvc repro` looking for a module that existed on the
# author's disk and in no clone. The ml-smoke job now asserts that every .py
# file under ml/ is tracked, so this cannot happen quietly again.
!ml/data/
!ml/src/manovia_ml/data/

# Day 35 retrieval: the fitted cross-encoder coefficients are weights (AGENTS.md
# ML ground rule 3), regenerated by `make ml-retrieval-rerank`, which installs
# them here with --install-backend. `tuning.json` beside them is calibration data
# — a fusion weight, two abstain floors and the fingerprints of the splits they
# were fitted on — so it IS committed, and the ignore lists these two files
# rather than the directory.
backend/app/ml_artifacts/retrieval_v1/reranker_weights.json
backend/app/ml_artifacts/retrieval_v1/reranker.json
